<title>USA: USDA to donate 6,000 tonnes veg oil to Armenia.</title>
<headline>USDA to donate 6,000 tonnes veg oil to Armenia.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it will donate about 6,000 tonnes of vegetable oil to the United Methodist Committee on Relief to distribute in Armenia.</p>
<p>USDA said the donation was made under its Food for Progress Program and that the supply period is fiscal year 1996.</p>
<p>It said the vegetable oil will be sold to private businesses in Armenia and the proceeds will be used by the charity to support projects such as health and education programs.</p>
